{
  "nodes": [
    { "id": "intro", "type": "text", "x": 0, "y": -240, "width": 1560, "height": 180, "text": "# FlyRight · App icon directions\n\nA clearer mark. A more confident FlyRight.\n\nFour editable vector concepts for review. The existing navy, silver and porcelain palette comes from the FlyRight design-system artifact (snapshot synced 2026-09-20, main@02c3dbd). No installed app assets changed.\n\nOpen `design/icon-directions/canvas.html` for interactive colour, mask, size and current-icon comparisons." },
    { "id": "a-image", "type": "file", "file": "design/icon-directions/assets/a-board.png", "x": 0, "y": 0, "width": 360, "height": 484 },
    { "id": "b-image", "type": "file", "file": "design/icon-directions/assets/b-board.png", "x": 400, "y": 0, "width": 360, "height": 484 },
    { "id": "c-image", "type": "file", "file": "design/icon-directions/assets/c-board.png", "x": 800, "y": 0, "width": 360, "height": 484 },
    { "id": "d-image", "type": "file", "file": "design/icon-directions/assets/d-board.png", "x": 1200, "y": 0, "width": 360, "height": 484 },
    { "id": "a-notes", "type": "text", "x": 0, "y": 520, "width": 360, "height": 260, "text": "## A / Contrail · Recommended\n\nDeparture and reassurance in one continuous shape. Keeps the idea that belongs to FlyRight, with a broad leading edge and tapered tail.\n\n**Consideration:** More abstract than a literal plane.\n\n**Brand relationship:** Evolution of the existing contrail check." },
    { "id": "b-notes", "type": "text", "x": 400, "y": 520, "width": 360, "height": 260, "text": "## B / Wingform\n\nAn italic F built from swept-wing geometry. A distinctive signature that can extend to a wordmark, website and splash screen.\n\n**Consideration:** Needs the FlyRight name to establish recognition.\n\n**Brand relationship:** Explores a new monogram instead of the check." },
    { "id": "c-notes", "type": "text", "x": 800, "y": 520, "width": 360, "height": 260, "text": "## C / Orbit\n\nAn open flight path connects the mark to the World experience and a lifetime of travel.\n\n**Consideration:** The orbit contains more detail at the smallest sizes.\n\n**Brand relationship:** Explores a route-led alternative to the check." },
    { "id": "d-notes", "type": "text", "x": 1200, "y": 520, "width": 360, "height": 260, "text": "## D / Departure\n\nA custom aircraft, optically centred and drawn for this icon. Clear aviation recognition with the surrounding decoration removed.\n\n**Consideration:** Less distinct in a category full of aircraft.\n\n**Brand relationship:** Keeps the aircraft, removes the check." },
    { "id": "decision", "type": "text", "x": 0, "y": 840, "width": 1560, "height": 180, "text": "## Review first\n\nMy recommendation is **A / Contrail**, in navy with the bright-silver mark. It keeps the most useful part of the current identity and improves its small-size presence. Porcelain is also included so appearance can be chosen separately from the symbol.\n\nThese are visual studies. Rounded and circle masks are approximations; actual iOS renditions, Android adaptive foreground/background and themed masks should be prepared after a direction is selected. The one-colour tile demonstrates silhouette legibility; it is not an installable Android mask." }
  ],
  "edges": []
}
